WEBVTT

00:02:00.913 --> 00:02:03.121
We just needed to trust people to deliver,

00:02:03.163 --> 00:02:04.413
and they did.

00:02:05.121 --> 00:02:07.454
So I'm on a mission.

00:02:07.496 --> 00:02:11.829
A mission to bottle
these great work practices

00:02:11.871 --> 00:02:14.788
and not go back to the old ways.

00:02:14.829 --> 00:02:18.371
And yes, of course, I want
to get rid of endless back-to-back zooms

00:02:18.413 --> 00:02:21.621
and loneliness and days
that blend into evenings.

00:02:21.663 --> 00:02:24.788
But we have to make sure we don't go back

00:02:24.829 --> 00:02:28.454
to the rigid, structured, bureaucratic,

00:02:28.496 --> 00:02:32.038
sluggish ways that sucked
the joy out of work.